==============================================================================
4. IRREDUCIBLE NOISE FLOOR (near-identical flights)
==============================================================================

Flights matched on progressively more of what's observable. The
within-group sd of TRUE taxi bounds what ANY model could achieve on
rows it cannot otherwise distinguish. Compare to the model's own
residual sd on the same rows.

  (computed on the ordinary lane: n=299,602, model RMSE=206.4s)

  matched on                   groups      rows   within sd  model resid sd
  airport + day                   558   299,602       348.9           204.2
  + hour                       10,779   298,776       315.0           195.2
  + runway                     17,329   296,133       300.6           191.9
  + stand group                32,306   246,297       284.4           187.8
  + aircraft type              23,205    99,911       276.4           185.5

  If 'model resid sd' has already fallen to ~'within sd' at the
  finest matching, the model is extracting essentially everything
  these covariates contain and new features must bring genuinely
  orthogonal information to beat it.
